### How the Password-Protected Sharing Works

You can use this tool to securely share a file in three simple steps. The page handles the upload, link generation, and password check entirely in your browser.

*   **Upload & Set Password:** First, select the file you want to share and enter a password of your choice in the designated fields.
*   **Generate & Share Link:** Clicking the "Upload & generate link" button creates a unique, shareable link. A copy button lets you easily send it to friends.
*   **Secure Download:** When a friend opens the link, they will see the file's details and a password field. They can only start the download after entering the correct password you set.
